{"id":"7669c7bf82c59020","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-recursion3-primitive-recursive-function.md","title":"ZFC Recursion3 Primitive Recursive Function","display":"df-zfc-recursion3-primitive-recursive-function — ZFC Recursion3 Primitive Recursive Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-primitive-recursive-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion3-primitive-recursive-function"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion3-primitive-recursive-function — ZFC Recursion3 Primitive Recursive Function","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-primitive-recursive-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion3-primitive-recursive-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion3-primitive-recursive-function — ZFC Recursion3 Primitive Recursive Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1cf46a0ea13ab5dd\" href=\"?note=1cf46a0ea13ab5dd\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md\">../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,F,g,h,\\vec h,k,m\\in V\">\\(f,F,g,h,\\vec h,k,m\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fn}_\\omega\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\omega^{\\omega^k}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fn}_\\omega\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\omega^{\\omega^k}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec h(i)\">\\(\\vec h(i)\\)</span> 是函数族的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 项。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrimRec}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{PrimRec}_S\\)</span> 的既有五元、四元接口保持不变。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PR}\">\\(\\mathsf{PR}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3PrimitiveRecursiveFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3PrimitiveRecursiveFunction}_S\\)</span> 在下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}_S\\)</span> 使用已有内部定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_k\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\vec x,0\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\}\">\\(Z_k\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\vec x,0\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,x+1\\rangle:x\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(S\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,x+1\\rangle:x\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i^k\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\vec x,\\vec x(i)\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\pi_i^k\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\vec x,\\vec x(i)\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}composition}\\vdash\\operatorname{Comp}_S(F,g,\\vec h,k,m)\\leftrightarrow k,m\\in\\omega\\land g\\in\\omega^{\\omega^m}\\land\\vec h\\in(\\omega^{\\omega^k})^m\\land F\\in\\omega^{\\omega^k}\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\;\\Bigl(F(\\vec x)=g(\\langle \\vec h(i)(\\vec x):i\\in m\\rangle)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}composition}\\vdash\\operatorname{Comp}_S(F,g,\\vec h,k,m)\\leftrightarrow k,m\\in\\omega\\land g\\in\\omega^{\\omega^m}\\land\\vec h\\in(\\omega^{\\omega^k})^m\\land F\\in\\omega^{\\omega^k}\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\;\\Bigl(F(\\vec x)=g(\\langle \\vec h(i)(\\vec x):i\\in m\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PrimRec}_S(F,g,h,k)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;k\\in\\omega\\land g\\in\\omega^{\\omega^k}\\land h\\in\\omega^{\\omega^{k+2}}\\land F\\in\\omega^{\\omega^{k+1}}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\;\\Bigl(F(\\vec x^\\frown\\langle0\\rangle)=g(\\vec x)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;F(\\vec x^\\frown\\langle n+1\\rangle)=h(\\vec x^\\frown\\langle n,F(\\vec x^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle)\\rangle)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PrimRec}_S(F,g,h,k)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;k\\in\\omega\\land g\\in\\omega^{\\omega^k}\\land h\\in\\omega^{\\omega^{k+2}}\\land F\\in\\omega^{\\omega^{k+1}}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\;\\Bigl(F(\\vec x^\\frown\\langle0\\rangle)=g(\\vec x)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;F(\\vec x^\\frown\\langle n+1\\rangle)=h(\\vec x^\\frown\\langle n,F(\\vec x^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle)\\rangle)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}function}\n\\vdash\\mathsf{PR}=\\bigcap\\left\\{C\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fn}_\\omega:\n{}\\right.&amp;\\{\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,S(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\omega\\}\\in C\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;(Z_k\\in C)\n\\land\\forall k\\geq1\\;\\forall i&lt;k\\;(\\pi_i^k\\in C)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall k,m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall g\\in C\\cap\\omega^{\\omega^m}\\;\n\\forall\\vec h\\in(C\\cap\\omega^{\\omega^k})^m\\;\n\\exists F\\in C\\;\\operatorname{Comp}_S(F,g,\\vec h,k,m)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\left.\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\forall g\\in C\\cap\\omega^{\\omega^k}\\;\n\\forall h\\in C\\cap\\omega^{\\omega^{k+2}}\\;\n\\exists F\\in C\\;\\operatorname{PrimRec}_S(F,g,h,k)\\right\\},\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}function}\n\\vdash\\mathsf{PR}=\\bigcap\\left\\{C\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fn}_\\omega:\n{}\\right.&amp;\\{\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,S(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\omega\\}\\in C\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;(Z_k\\in C)\n\\land\\forall k\\geq1\\;\\forall i&lt;k\\;(\\pi_i^k\\in C)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall k,m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall g\\in C\\cap\\omega^{\\omega^m}\\;\n\\forall\\vec h\\in(C\\cap\\omega^{\\omega^k})^m\\;\n\\exists F\\in C\\;\\operatorname{Comp}_S(F,g,\\vec h,k,m)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\left.\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\forall g\\in C\\cap\\omega^{\\omega^k}\\;\n\\forall h\\in C\\cap\\omega^{\\omega^{k+2}}\\;\n\\exists F\\in C\\;\\operatorname{PrimRec}_S(F,g,h,k)\\right\\},\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3PrimitiveRecursiveFunction}_S(f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(f\\in\\omega^{\\omega^k}\\land f\\in\\mathsf{PR}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3PrimitiveRecursiveFunction}_S(f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(f\\in\\omega^{\\omega^k}\\land f\\in\\mathsf{PR}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every closure clause now records the input and output arities, so\nill-typed compositions and primitive recursions are excluded.</li>\n<li>合成与本原递归输出均由显式函数图关系刻画，不再依赖只用自然语言指定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrimRec}\">\\(\\operatorname{PrimRec}\\)</span> 操作符。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md","status":"resolved","id":"1cf46a0ea13ab5dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,F,g,h,\\vec h,k,m\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fn}_\\omega\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\omega^{\\omega^k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec h(i)","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PrimRec}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3PrimitiveRecursiveFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\ma